## Managed by unattended-installer for complete CrowdSec post-exploitation
## visibility. Include root and user login sessions, exclude only audit events
## without a valid login UID, and include both syscall ABIs so 32-bit payloads
## cannot bypass the auditd scenarios.
-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -S execve -S execveat -F auid>=0 -F auid!=4294967295 -F key=crowdsec-exec
-a always,exit -F arch=b32 -S execve -S execveat -F auid>=0 -F auid!=4294967295 -F key=crowdsec-exec
